><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world scarred by war and teetering on the brink of famine, an unlikely hero rises with a surprising gift. Step into the paws of Doug as he endeavors to save his town from disaster, where his culinary pursuits attract both friends and foes alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbBecome the top dog!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/958e3fd0265d504fc7c454f68c256036.poster.avif?t=1774258692\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/958e3fd0265d504fc7c454f68c256036.webm?t=1774258692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/958e3fd0265d504fc7c454f68c256036.mp4?t=1774258692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and tame plant creatures in top-down shooter combat with a twist! Master the art of color switching to survive the wilderness, all while collecting valuable ingredients for your restaurant.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbLet him cook.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/669b477efed4a30a7a3af14cf1f96858.poster.avif?t=1774258692\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/669b477efed4a30a7a3af14cf1f96858.webm?t=1774258692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/669b477efed4a30a7a3af14cf1f96858.mp4?t=1774258692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day of foraging, cook up your spoils in the restaurant. Discover a variety of dishes, watch out for trends, and cater to your customers' unique taste preferences. If things get too hectic, then relax the music (and difficulty)!</p>","developers":["Team Soleil"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/b0ee7e8c49e57de199bc08dc2ce53f40c6a46154/header.jpg?t=1774258692","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Dogwood","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i5-3470 or AMD Ryzen 5 3400G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 or AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Team Soleil"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Schimpfw\u00f6rte\nFantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/da9596779e60ca195f8a6e8c7b53df16ad77a4b1/ss_da9596779e60ca195f8a6e8c7b53df16ad77a4b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774258692","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/da9596779e60ca195f8a6e8c7b53df16ad77a4b1/ss_da9596779e60ca195f8a6e8c7